requirements_summary:
- Support 5k/day baseline, handle spikes to 20k/day;
- Dedicated GPU capacity in VPC with autoscale/burst;
- API hooks to write tags and trigger macros in Zendesk;
- Audit logs + KMS + SSO;
- Field-level mapping for 12 custom Zendesk fields;
- SLA target: median tagging latency <800ms baseline, <2s under moderate spikes.
